{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 721, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf8e7f25ef374f0b2f1b2f1c781432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef369f36df8b2f473f0eff0a5f29ef0a9f7d12f2ff0b0f0b18143f273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "쌍무를 움직이려면，//엄청난 영력이 필요하겠군…//칸나，괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武を動かすには、//すさまじい霊力が必要だな……//カンナ、大丈夫か？", "pointer_offset": 612, "unit": "dialogue:b43ebe1d3b781a84", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 790, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f372f372f372f7d1f0aff16bf27ef0a4f8f4f287f0af81442f2ff0e2f0e4f8b9f0c0f0a5f1c7f7d12f2ff8b2f18ef0f4f1578143f1e4f9c8f0aff0b8f0a8f1848144", "baseline_text": "헤헤헤…아무렇지도 않아．//대장에 비하면…//이 정도는，별거 아니라고．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "へへへ……へっちゃらだよ。//隊長にくらべたら……//これくらい、なんともないさ。", "pointer_offset": 616, "unit": "dialogue:cacab1f0c2e3b1f7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 869, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0d8f1d9f9d4f263f0b2f148f7d12f2ff0e2f0e4f0f3f7d1f1b7f8f3f0adf2c3f0c82f2ff6b7f15af0a4f984f154f276f0af8148", "baseline_text": "그치만 말이야…//대장은…많은 마음을//짊어지고 있잖아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だってさ……//隊長は……たくさんの気持ちを//背負ってるんだろ？", "pointer_offset": 620, "unit": "dialogue:9bf49c31cdc8b21f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 932, "capacity": 78, "raw_hex": "f271f0f9f8e1f0adf2c3f0b2f0a8f2c0f144f7d12f2ff0eff0f0f8cff0a6f240f17cf27af8e1f0adf2c3f0b2f0a8f2c0f144f7d12f2ff0dff8f4f0a6f17df1daf8e1f0adfac3f263f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "모두의 마음이라든가…//요네다 사령관님의 마음이라든가…//제도 사람들의 마음 말이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "みんなの気持ちとか……//米田司令の気持ちとか……//帝都の人たちの気持ちとかさ。", "pointer_offset": 624, "unit": "dialogue:ed8bb312f766694b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1011, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0c7f0b8f261f7d12f2ff99cf266f18ef8f3f0a5f8a4f0ad8144", "baseline_text": "그러니까…//내 걱정은 하지 마．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから……//あたいのことは心配すんな。", "pointer_offset": 628, "unit": "dialogue:13eeee044925044a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1050, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f99cf1ccf0f32f2ff19cf944f2c9f0aff947fa57f2aff0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "내 일은//내가 알아서 할 테니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "自分のことは、//自分でなんとかするからさ。", "pointer_offset": 632, "unit": "dialogue:c6c6d6467f95bf22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1093, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f7d1", "baseline_text": "칸나…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナ……", "pointer_offset": 636, "unit": "dialogue:23a4dacbfc15afd3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1104, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f0b0f8b1f266f98efa64f0a5f8f1f94bf2658144", "baseline_text": "나도 칸나 걱정 좀 하게 해 줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナのことも心配させてくれ。", "pointer_offset": 640, "unit": "dialogue:32473e709319a54c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1135, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15a8143f266f98ef991f257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "알았어，걱정 안 할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかった、心配しない。", "pointer_offset": 644, "unit": "dialogue:264b1272bd7054dd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1158, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f0b0f8b1f266f98efa64f0a5f8f1f94bf26581442f2ff273f274f0a48143f0b0f0b18148", "baseline_text": "나도 칸나 걱정 좀 하게 해 줘．//괜찮지，칸나？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナのことも心配させてくれ。//いいだろ、カンナ？", "pointer_offset": 648, "unit": "dialogue:acc7b93043fa167c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 2014, "capacity": 72, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0aff7d1fa81f263f0aef957f1d6f0a1f0b2f0a8f0b8f26181442f2ff0a4f17bf8f3f1f7fad6f140f0b2f0a8f184f7d12f2ff16bfa89f18ff0aef8e7f0a5f957f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "하아…못 말리는 녀석이라니까．//지금은 전투 중이라고…//무슨 소리를 하는 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はぁ……しょうがねぇヤツだな。//今は戦闘中だぜ……//なに言ってんだよ。", "pointer_offset": 652, "unit": "dialogue:2422ff8bedf1cc05", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1280, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d48143f0d8fa62f0e2f0e4f0b2f0a8f147f7d12f2ff1cff0aff0a5f8f1f9fbf1c8f0a4f9d4f263f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "하지만，그런 대장이라서…//좋아하게 된 거지만 말이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、そんな隊長だから……//好きになったんだけどね。", "pointer_offset": 656, "unit": "dialogue:8c46dea8b6b4d65e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1333, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f7d1", "baseline_text": "칸나…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナ……", "pointer_offset": 660, "unit": "dialogue:23a4dacbfc15afd3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1344, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af81b82f2ff0d8facaf1bcf0b2f14781432f2ff1a9faf9f163f4b0f0a5f8f1f94bf366f26181b8", "baseline_text": "좋아∈//그럼 둘이서，//한판 화끈하게 해 볼까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よ～し！//それじゃ二人で、//いっちょ、パーッとやるか∈", "pointer_offset": 664, "unit": "dialogue:7dbae00d1b07e9ce", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1399, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15a8143f266f98ef991f257f0f181442f2ff0b0f0b18143f254f0faf947f484f99cf2658144", "baseline_text": "알았어，걱정 안 할게．//칸나，혼자서 힘내 줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかった、心配しない。//カンナ、一人でがんばってくれ。", "pointer_offset": 668, "unit": "dialogue:06bf7bda1488c912", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1454, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0a2f0af81acf24cf24df0b6f7d12f2ff15af256f0f1fac0f0a5f29ef0cff984f263f9a9f28a81432f2ff0b1f0a4f9d4f263f0b2f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "으아〓확실히…//어떻게든 하겠다고 말한 건，//나지만 말이야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え〓　た、確かに……//なんとかするって言ったのは、//あたいだけどさ……", "pointer_offset": 672, "unit": "dialogue:f2e43b2ec69d8a8f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1525, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0aff7d12f2ff0d8fa8af263f8b2f0d8f27ef0cff957f1c8f184f7d1", "baseline_text": "있잖아…//그건 말이 그렇다는 거고…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あのさ……//それは言葉のあやってやつで……", "pointer_offset": 676, "unit": "dialogue:6bdf1f3bfae8158a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1568, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0a6f24df8f3f266f18ef94bf1e2faa2f1abf0a8f957f1c8f0a48148", "baseline_text": "사실은 걱정해 주길 바라는 거지？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "本当は心配してほしいんだろ？", "pointer_offset": 680, "unit": "dialogue:f1b3d1b349ac42b7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1597, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f253f14ff7d1f25c81432f2ff0d8fa62f258f0b2f0a48144", "baseline_text": "저기…뭐，//그런 셈이지．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あの……まぁ、//そういうことだ。", "pointer_offset": 684, "unit": "dialogue:be7203eaa2484bc3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1630, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f2c9f984f154f15a81442f2ff0b1f0f4f7d12f2ff0b0f0b1f8e7f0dbf9c2f2e4f984f154f0cff1848144", "baseline_text": "알고 있어．//나도…//칸나를 신경 쓰고 있다고．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかってるよ。//俺だって……//カンナのことを気にしてるさ。", "pointer_offset": 688, "unit": "dialogue:478bb8b0f08a8907", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1689, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f7d1f1abf1ac8144", "baseline_text": "…바보．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……バカ。", "pointer_offset": 692, "unit": "dialogue:102d3d829d06674b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1700, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "fb89f0d8f14381482f2ff19cf944f25c2f2ff0b2f26af9a9f263f0b2f0a8f8f4f0ccf15a8148", "baseline_text": "왜 그래？//내가 뭐//이상한 말이라도 했어？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうした？//あたいが何か//おかしなこと言ったか？", "pointer_offset": 696, "unit": "dialogue:f00310312ff18cb7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1749, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b88143f0b0f8b1f0b1f3def0e2f0a32f2ff0dff0e2f8a3f0c6f0f7f0a5f984f154f0cff1842f2ff0c6f0f7f14bf947f263f0b2f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "아니，칸나 나름대로//제대로 생각하고 있다고//생각해서 말이야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや、カンナなりに//しっかりと考えているなと//思ってね……", "pointer_offset": 700, "unit": "dialogue:237413e4abab893f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1808, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f25af16bf0a5f0f08143f0e2f0e481442f2ff0b1f8f4f263f0b2f14881432f2ff0e9f0a6f0a5f957f0adf2c3f8f3f154f0cff1688144", "baseline_text": "너무하네，대장．//나도 말이야，//감사하는 마음은 있다구．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ひっでえなあ、隊長。//あたいだって、//感謝の気持ちはあるんだぜ。", "pointer_offset": 704, "unit": "dialogue:ad4d20438313141d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1873, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0abf1918143f0abf191f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f1f7f2d6f8e7f3cff1f4f257f26181b82f2ff0b0f0b18143f484f8c8f48ef9b2f26581b8", "baseline_text": "미안，미안…//그럼，전투를 재개할까∈//칸나，힘을 빌려 줘∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ごめん、ごめん……//それじゃ、戦闘再開といこうか！//カンナ、力をかしてくれ！", "pointer_offset": 708, "unit": "dialogue:7fca713acc276582", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 1950, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f362fac6f0f9f0a8f18481b82f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf163f164f165f8e1f484f0c8f7d12f2ff1acf9bef1e2f0faf18481b8", "baseline_text": "맡겨 두라고∈//오오가미 화격단의 힘을…//보여 주자고∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まかせとけって！//大神華撃団の力……//見せつけてやろうぜ！", "pointer_offset": 712, "unit": "dialogue:22ba12508eb17b76", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04009.SBN", "offset": 2009, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 716, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
